ols structure supplier communication and competition, but each format has a different purpose."}, {"id": "15401ca9-4ab6-433e-811b-65b4c5f8b519", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Competitive event mechanics", "children": [{"id": "c6092c3d-928c-4ecc-b46d-c2d6a23800c0", "type": "concept", "title": "Bid calendars and bidder conferences"}, {"id": "ecb57448-1a90-4f17-a366-9cc9ca4abb0b", "type": "concept", "title": "Clarifications and addenda"}, {"id": "a40011a6-71da-43a8-aad1-1f8f87accf04", "type": "concept", "title": "Reverse auctions"}, {"id": "94bf23e3-eb0b-469e-a30b-5b4663c178e4", "type": "concept", "title": "Fairness, confidentiality, and conflict of interest controls"}], "description": "Students learn when competition improves outcomes and when it can damage quality, trust, or supply security."}, {"id": "8715ab28-394f-440e-bebc-ff9ea3d4d547", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Source-to-contract execution", "children": [{"id": "d9fe6235-a7f6-4794-af84-353b95a07801", "type": "concept", "title": "Bid evaluation matrices"}, {"id": "330ed6ee-3f8b-40fc-ad2e-def1a2924e20", "type": "concept", "title": "Award scenarios and optimization"}, {"id": "514ccc8b-aee2-4071-a23a-fa259a3f168d", "type": "concept", "title": "Negotiation down-selects"}, {"id": "0b575112-fda4-4ea3-b05d-b1c14687bc12", "type": "concept", "title": "Contract handoff and implementation planning"}], "description": "Source-to-contract is the disciplined handoff from sourcing strategy to award, contracting, and implementation."}]}, {"id": "780e6597-872c-4174-b360-282cc12a5011", "type": "topic", "title": "Negotiation Strategy, Game Planning, and Supplier Economics", "description": "Prepare sourcing negotiations through interests, alternatives, cost drivers, power, ethics, and relationship goals.", "children": [{"id": "5b965032-2ae6-4606-a743-cf3abcd23dad", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Negotiation preparation", "children": [{"id": "f8ac6cd0-96f6-4f1e-919c-d076c4065254", "type": "concept", "title": "Interests, positions, and objectives"}, {"id": "a1976eaf-1727-4410-a7ff-231149121c97", "type": "concept", "title": "BATNA and walk-away points"}, {"id": "7d009f8d-84e2-45e0-a936-35707c97be55", "type": "concept", "title": "Issue lists and concession planning"}, {"id": "f944d9af-9feb-4d86-ba76-ec5a72855ef0", "type": "concept", "title": "Stakeholder alignment and negotiation mandate"}], "description": "Preparation determines the quality of the conversation before the first meeting happens."}, {"id": "7f36091e-50c1-4373-91b4-285c690abca9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Commercial negotiation tactics", "children": [{"id": "dbf62945-99f7-4e81-ad64-c74f0e207f48", "type": "concept", "title": "Anchoring and framing"}, {"id": "2f68fb71-4ee5-4b06-8d8b-04f6cc4f7a42", "type": "concept", "title": "Package trades and logrolling"}, {"id": "ae1037d3-975c-416c-bae2-1e5f05812c21", "type": "concept", "title": "Should-cost arguments"}, {"id": "39fefa6c-f983-42cd-8d06-480358e040b0", "type": "concept", "title": "Multi-round negotiation strategy"}], "description": "Students practice concrete tactics while learning to avoid manipulative or unethical behavior."}, {"id": "a3eca6a3-cdf1-4277-9f07-120f7844534a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Relationship and cross-cultural negotiation", "children": [{"id": "f6fdbef4-d271-4061-9897-ee0c9b1903fa", "type": "concept", "title": "Trust, credibility, and tone"}, {"id": "cc554715-2390-4f77-83e2-bb8897fcdcd3", "type": "concept", "title": "Cultural differences in negotiation norms"}, {"id": "157e6677-845c-4652-9b29-e0a393a608ec", "type": "concept", "title": "Difficult conversations and impasse management"}, {"id": "89f53452-96ba-4f27-96ea-51bbb8caf99b", "type": "concept", "title": "Ethics, transparency, and documentation"}], "description": "Procurement negotiations must often preserve long-term collaboration while still defending business interests."}]}, {"id": "db61482a-c905-425a-9be3-ec095e5ecffb", "type": "topic", "title": "Contracts, Commercial Terms, Risk Allocation, and Compliance", "description": "Understand how procurement agreements convert sourcing decisions into enforceable obligations, protections, incentives, and governance.", "children": [{"id": "38e6ec5b-6157-44b2-8623-34966113b8fb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Contract structure", "children": [{"id": "904630be-913b-4c1a-8ede-bbc62e103fbd", "type": "concept", "title": "Master service agreements"}, {"id": "6af77cb1-283b-4997-8ae5-fc978c39c2a7", "type": "concept", "title": "Statements of work"}, {"id": "4c29d5bb-1599-40ff-97bc-aeff77453498", "type": "concept", "title": "Purchase terms and conditions"}, {"id": "3278485d-c930-4680-9365-64823d5f9ca8", "type": "concept", "title": "Order of precedence and exhibits"}], "description": "Students learn the anatomy of procurement agreements so they can read risks and obligations intelligently."}, {"id": "691b845e-dfe0-4f75-816c-e302d6c837ed", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Commercial and legal terms", "children": [{"id": "35b68757-ee39-4489-8d83-9a44cad03750", "type": "concept", "title": "Pricing, payment, indexation, and escalation"}, {"id": "d37b4589-1b9d-4267-9ec3-35943aeb7a45", "type": "concept", "title": "Service levels and warranties"}, {"id": "83c43150-1a4b-431f-96f8-7805f7613f64", "type": "concept", "title": "Limitation of liability and indemnity"}, {"id": "91b58610-c976-43c0-bc7b-1e3eae4ef9d1", "type": "concept", "title": "Termination, renewal, and change control"}], "description": "Commercial terms allocate money, timing, risk, accountability, and remedies across the buyer-supplier relationship."}, {"id": "b283cf36-8b28-4a10-8148-4d498d638466", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Compliance and contract governance", "children": [{"id": "a46c50b4-b310-4c1a-90aa-5765fcc1d02e", "type": "concept", "title": "Contract lifecycle management"}, {"id": "4649e1e9-29f3-4282-85b6-efcee6c159ed", "type": "concept", "title": "Delegation, approval, and records retention"}, {"id": "00f5ba22-4514-41c3-bfc1-588f60436349", "type": "concept", "title": "Regulatory and audit obligations"}, {"id": "496be540-63ed-4257-bf1b-44b903f5acf2", "type": "concept", "title": "Dispute resolution and escalation paths"}], "description": "Governance keeps the contract alive after signature and reduces disputes, leakage, and compliance failures."}]}, {"id": "7a416d29-4ee3-4695-b45b-571428fafc8d", "type": "topic", "title": "Supplier Relationship Management and Supplier Performance", "description": "Move beyond award decisions into performance management, collaboration, issue resolution, and value creation across supplier relationships.", "children": [{"id": "ba584590-2494-434c-ac70-2a2b0653eb63", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Supplier segmentation", "children": [{"id": "af4508cc-a6ad-488b-8515-86451c6df003", "type": "concept", "title": "Strategic, preferred, transactional, and emerging suppliers"}, {"id": "52d5a7c7-7443-478f-b29b-bd301ffc0f08", "type": "concept", "title": "Spend, risk, innovation, and dependency criteria"}, {"id": "7b9226fd-cf79-4262-9077-3fd5901eeaf8", "type": "concept", "title": "Tiered governance"}, {"id": "85e8642d-1f54-4b28-8f0c-c7f1e0d91699", "type": "concept", "title": "Relationship charters"}], "description": "Not every supplier relationship deserves the same management model; segmentation directs attention where it matters most."}, {"id": "c0051f4d-046f-4497-bbef-477c451cae46", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Performance management", "children": [{"id": "fb8ccab1-acfa-4ca5-b44f-d84809a06607", "type": "concept", "title": "Supplier scorecards"}, {"id": "7b52095a-d65c-4f07-94f7-7d8a36d7c874", "type": "concept", "title": "OTIF, quality, cost, responsiveness, and innovation metrics"}, {"id": "de79b36f-58d3-4746-a3bc-16b9341b7e16", "type": "concept", "title": "Quarterly business reviews"}, {"id": "9d7399c6-230f-4a0b-b4d6-0a169f3e71a5", "type": "concept", "title": "Corrective and preventive action"}], "description": "Performance management converts expectations into metrics, reviews, corrective actions, and improvement work."}, {"id": "0f5e7dac-8742-4395-b30c-c7d00831afbf", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Collaboration and value creation", "children": [{"id": "feff2d33-d506-468e-8093-11b2faca4217", "type": "concept", "title": "Joint business planning"}, {"id": "d8f6182b-823a-4b18-8e66-657931d7b415", "type": "concept", "title": "Supplier innovation days"}, {"id": "99f89886-c139-43c0-9c21-cf3981f3ae88", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost reduction workshops"}, {"id": "8d4aa592-dd0e-43e8-afbb-31a8ae3c98ea", "type": "concept", "title": "Gainsharing and collaborative improvement"}], "description": "Strong supplier relationships can unlock innovation, resilience, and process improvements that competitive bidding alone cannot create."}]}, {"id": "13bd0c34-6313-4276-86e9-13a023c46d60", "type": "topic", "title": "Global Sourcing, Logistics Interfaces, and Trade/Geopolitical Risk", "description": "Connect sourcing choices to trade rules, country risk, logistics constraints, Incoterms, currency, and geopolitical exposure.", "children": [{"id": "9aebc8d2-1605-4831-ba4a-113057f65822", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Global sourcing strategy", "children": [{"id": "8f73da99-8f8a-4c16-9956-895933f92fad", "type": "concept", "title": "Offshoring, nearshoring, reshoring, and friend-shoring"}, {"id": "877081db-63a0-4efa-9ff9-11c7b59e0f37", "type": "concept", "title": "Country and supplier-country analysis"}, {"id": "b9005627-84eb-4900-b006-d682e307a5da", "type": "concept", "title": "Currency and inflation exposure"}, {"id": "1df89d32-630f-4bbe-aeab-f65ce0a0733e", "type": "concept", "title": "Global category strategy"}], "description": "Global sourcing expands options but introduces distance, uncertainty, compliance obligations, and coordination costs."}, {"id": "6fdce52a-c4d0-414c-8876-a3522b6e526e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Trade and logistics interface", "children": [{"id": "ab05900f-7b7e-4515-968a-323111844baa", "type": "concept", "title": "Incoterms and transfer of responsibility"}, {"id": "53b1cccd-ed27-4db3-a399-b885edf856f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Customs documentation and classification"}, {"id": "b1f0d30c-84e0-4648-adf9-3e7f15a4e0af", "type": "concept", "title": "Duties, tariffs, and landed cost"}, {"id": "4aed9ac5-34b9-4f3f-97b4-578e20546af7", "type": "concept", "title": "Freight mode, lead time, and port risk"}], "description": "Procurement decisions must account for how goods physically and legally move across borders."}, {"id": "0caf241d-1cbe-4567-a385-b285fe38d4c6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Geopolitical and disruption risk", "children": [{"id": "65db855e-1d7f-437c-aef1-30e5bb1612f0", "type": "concept", "title": "Sanctions and export controls"}, {"id": "3646631f-0684-4e0e-a520-380079755d8d", "type": "concept", "title": "Political instability and trade disputes"}, {"id": "631283ac-a1e4-4367-ad6d-d4a741da6092", "type": "concept", "title": "Natural disasters and climate exposure"}, {"id": "08b45ae4-287c-422c-9c37-2248b4334af9", "type": "concept", "title": "Dual sourcing and regional redundancy"}], "description": "Students learn to connect sourcing maps with events that can interrupt supply or change total cost suddenly."}]}, {"id": "ce29bf11-25d9-4661-b6c4-add1a5d05f13", "type": "topic", "title": "Ethical, Sustainable, Diverse, and Responsible Sourcing", "description": "Integrate labor standards, environmental impact, supplier diversity, traceability, and responsible business conduct into sourcing decisions.", "children": [{"id": "53b32d0d-f41b-4470-b3ff-7ff3f5c5eb4d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Responsible sourcing principles", "children": [{"id": "e0d84cd1-f8f1-4434-8d52-486e650dca96", "type": "concept", "title": "Human rights and labor standards"}, {"id": "73f8ebe9-8ec5-4763-b5e5-b8c45cbada7f", "type": "concept", "title": "Forced-labor and child-labor due diligence"}, {"id": "d57a31cb-640e-40da-a5df-8781ec680828", "type": "concept", "title": "Anti-corruption and gifts policies"}, {"id": "5dcd5c3b-a09b-4831-b3c8-dbfecaf6ed87", "type": "concept", "title": "Responsible business conduct frameworks"}], "description": "Responsible sourcing asks procurement to account for the people, communities, and ecosystems behind purchased goods and services."}, {"id": "5eafc0b2-ed61-40a8-8d8b-985a0f389c8c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sustainable procurement", "children": [{"id": "df63a30c-079e-416c-b4be-52624c2459d4", "type": "concept", "title": "Scope 3 emissions and supplier data"}, {"id": "66f98f03-1af4-47d6-b63e-2bc51a177266", "type": "concept", "title": "Circular economy and reuse"}, {"id": "cf4610da-f97c-48c8-94d2-2348cd17ddf5", "type": "concept", "title": "Packaging, waste, and water impacts"}, {"id": "489ba03c-9380-4539-adb6-af1fc73bf850", "type": "concept", "title": "Life-cycle thinking and eco-labels"}], "description": "Sustainable procurement links supplier choices to emissions, materials, waste, circularity, and lifecycle impact."}, {"id": "9f69be72-bfd7-4eaf-acef-59f9130ffbb2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Supplier diversity and inclusion", "children": [{"id": "967f300e-dd8f-402f-9bcc-3bad46b63b81", "type": "concept", "title": "Diverse supplier certification"}, {"id": "80c8355c-be92-448d-8c07-b86ba5b3dffd", "type": "concept", "title": "Inclusive sourcing targets"}, {"id": "5a3e1cb9-5cc5-4502-a83d-17dbd69f54da", "type": "concept", "title": "Second-tier diversity reporting"}, {"id": "8a5fc7c9-39d1-46c4-87cf-88767c676630", "type": "concept", "title": "Capacity building and fair access"}], "description": "Supplier diversity expands economic opportunity while strengthening market access, innovation, and community impact."}]}, {"id": "5f228d85-8647-458a-b4bc-d5ad52ab1df7", "type": "topic", "title": "Procurement Analytics, Cost Modeling, and Digital Procurement", "description": "Use analytical models, digital platforms, automation, and dashboards to improve spend visibility, sourcing decisions, and procurement execution.", "children": [{"id": "bce3b5fb-bead-4641-b47e-0ac2db3880ff", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cost and price analytics", "children": [{"id": "acf983c0-37ff-47c4-aba3-90995f02eee9", "type": "concept", "title": "Should-cost modeling"}, {"id": "6c70406a-bbd0-4a5c-9818-4a057a984817", "type": "concept", "title": "Price variance analysis"}, {"id": "710df2b8-f77a-4ab5-8364-fadd54f63949", "type": "concept", "title": "Index-based pricing"}, {"id": "2bc679b1-442c-432d-8bc6-6d9c0c949c28", "type": "concept", "title": "Regression and benchmarking"}], "description": "Analytics equips students to challenge quotes, explain cost movements, and build evidence-based recommendations."}, {"id": "ff971895-58aa-4428-82f4-609710da1d35", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Digital procurement platforms", "children": [{"id": "e811a015-b2b6-44cf-b3ff-1ec6aca15a60", "type": "concept", "title": "eSourcing tools"}, {"id": "f221e4fe-ada5-4b3c-9449-96870c197ca0", "type": "concept", "title": "Contract lifecycle management"}, {"id": "449ac442-73f1-4286-8c0c-c5da11eab4aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Supplier information management"}, {"id": "bf4d10d7-5463-401a-99a2-e44267bd270a", "type": "concept", "title": "Procure-to-pay and ERP integration"}], "description": "Digital platforms coordinate sourcing, contracting, supplier data, buying channels, and performance management."}, {"id": "83fc1b52-0153-4103-8a18-164b99019c25", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Automation, AI, and dashboards", "children": [{"id": "b6f77bac-ae8f-4465-bd9b-2e8cf71f399f", "type": "concept", "title": "Spend dashboards and savings trackers"}, {"id": "798cd6ad-b04e-4112-b1f0-548d903a01b9", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk monitoring feeds"}, {"id": "010d729c-8be6-4d4d-81a0-2e38aee62604", "type": "concept", "title": "Process mining and automation"}, {"id": "f5ceba76-5eec-4106-b26e-d2f09c96f7ef", "type": "concept", "title": "Generative AI use cases and governance"}], "description": "Modern procurement increasingly depends on decision support, automation, and control-tower visibility."}]}, {"id": "1300ece0-c627-4407-9cd9-d4dc01527824", "type": "topic", "title": "Risk, Resilience, Continuity, and Supplier Development", "description": "Identify supplier and supply-market vulnerabilities, design continuity plans, and develop suppliers when market capability is strategically important.", "children": [{"id": "0ea6e880-648d-40c1-a23a-fa4a5b43176b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Supplier risk management", "children": [{"id": "1167aefe-71a7-4153-acae-e71968b42821", "type": "concept", "title": "Financial, operational, quality, cyber, ESG, and geopolitical risk"}, {"id": "ba287721-560c-4ff4-9e4d-86927cfc56fe", "type": "concept", "title": "Critical supplier mapping"}, {"id": "4a03842b-5169-4e83-9bb8-8c1f64e4f077", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk scoring and heat maps"}, {"id": "129c92c5-4ae2-472e-8e67-b0be995ebc35", "type": "concept", "title": "Early-warning indicators"}], "description": "Supplier risk management identifies where dependence, fragility, or misconduct could damage the organization."}, {"id": "33b3642a-9e97-4c68-9d37-97fbdaf10891", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Continuity and resilience planning", "children": [{"id": "e142ee90-2dfe-44bc-a05f-ae4a3e1cb780", "type": "concept", "title": "Business continuity plans"}, {"id": "42186018-2da2-4b37-a34b-d0c78eb0a9ab", "type": "concept", "title": "Safety stock and buffer capacity"}, {"id": "3760c6be-ff84-4f49-a99c-db7b9886b8e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Alternate suppliers and substitution plans"}, {"id": "c485af77-5447-4ab3-a4a3-ae8e1d4b133f", "type": "concept", "title": "Scenario planning and stress testing"}], "description": "Resilience planning prepares the organization to absorb disruption and recover service faster."}, {"id": "a95dbe93-1745-4179-80a7-ee14266624d4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Supplier development", "children": [{"id": "97e420e7-a74d-458f-b47a-595564378a7a", "type": "concept", "title": "Capability assessments"}, {"id": "eb86ae68-7964-4eea-9900-447e8f2d41a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Joint improvement roadmaps"}, {"id": "622c6ed1-87fd-485c-99a1-31cca869ab74", "type": "concept", "title": "Quality and process development"}, {"id": "6f168d58-74b2-4eee-91e8-d68d9693d472", "type": "concept", "title": "Exit, remediation, and escalation decisions"}], "description": "When markets cannot immediately provide the required capability, buyers may need to help suppliers improve."}]}, {"id": "cd9bdcb1-8ee7-44cf-b1b1-9c6864d09d97", "type": "topic", "title": "Capstone: Strategic Sourcing Project and Executive Recommendation", "description": "Apply the course end-to-end by diagnosing a category, building a sourcing strategy, evaluating options, and presenting an executive recommendation.", "children": [{"id": "e83766ec-76f7-4d4e-b6d7-617cf1b1a569", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Category diagnosis", "children": [{"id": "ecb4dfcc-5b4e-4e82-a870-753b592e0176", "type": "concept", "title": "Problem statement and scope"}, {"id": "1630c287-1c1d-4b5d-80e6-0bfdce60c44b", "type": "concept", "title": "Baseline spend and demand profile"}, {"id": "312d128c-beea-4324-af10-61ef5c808e5e", "type": "concept", "title": "Supplier and market analysis"}, {"id": "5bb052e9-b358-4bb2-b282-6537e419f0cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Stakeholder interviews"}], "description": "The capstone begins with evidence: spend, demand, market structure, supplier performance, risk, and stakeholder needs."}, {"id": "8948df02-fd1a-40a0-9b51-d4bb2f711ebd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sourcing strategy and business case", "children": [{"id": "c1790a06-4c9b-4a46-b970-0df557b4c9ef", "type": "concept", "title": "Sourcing levers and scenario options"}, {"id": "8498f1e3-40c5-4316-b940-e6228a1bd19b", "type": "concept", "title": "Savings and value model"}, {"id": "53d9a905-6d15-4434-9163-f5959c603d7d", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk and sustainability implications"}, {"id": "2a215d46-196d-4e16-9f78-51772e32cd0a", "type": "concept", "title": "Implementation timeline and governance"}], "description": "Students synthesize analysis into a sourcing strategy that is credible, quantified, and implementable."}, {"id": "0a62ec52-8af4-4368-ac9a-2c0a03938f02", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Executive recommendation", "children": [{"id": "0dcab368-5b76-4ba0-878a-556be2c5b753", "type": "concept", "title": "Executive summary and decision ask"}, {"id": "9efc5ba1-5975-448b-8a23-27eec7e7a3c0", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence-backed tradeoffs"}, {"id": "2e092e16-6321-419c-a09c-4f931f2e0fdd", "type": "concept", "title": "Supplier award or negotiation plan"}, {"id": "6e18e85e-b4b5-4f6c-9981-473d13bccdbd", "type": "concept", "title": "Implementation risks and next steps"}], "description": "The final recommendation develops the communication discipline needed to persuade senior decision makers."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$procjson$::jsonb,
